{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20008","headline":"往河阳宿峡陵寄李侍御 · 孟郊","name":"往河阳宿峡陵寄李侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫天寒风悲屑屑，啼鸟遶树泉水噎。\n行路解鞍投古陵，苍苍隔山见微月。\n鴞鸣犬吠霜烟昏，开囊拂巾对盘飧。\n人生穷达感知己，明日投君申片言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20008.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20008","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}